<div class="hero-head" style="padding:56px 48px 0;text-align:center"><span class="k">Self-hosted monitoring, incident response and logs</span>
<h1 class="h1" style="margin-top:18px">Run monitoring and incident response on <em>a machine you own.</em></h1>
<p class="lead" style="margin:22px auto 0;max-width:560px">Self-hosted uptime monitoring, incident response and logs, for personal projects and small teams. When something breaks you hear it first, and every byte stays on your server.</p>
